      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "数年間、ある女性は隣人が怠惰だと思っていました。",
      "text_en": "For years, a woman thought her neighbor was lazy.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"かず\" data-defn=\"often/again and again/frequently/repeatedly\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">数</span><rt>かず</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ねんかん\" data-defn=\"(period of) a year; during an era\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">年間</span><rt>ねんかん</rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ある\" data-defn=\"there is / to exist (inanimate)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ある</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"じょせい\" data-defn=\"じょせい (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">女性</span><rt>じょせい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"りんじん\" data-defn=\"neighbour/neighbor/neighbourhood/neighborhood\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">隣人</span><rt>りんじん</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"が\" data-defn=\"subject marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">が</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"たいだ\" data-defn=\"lazy/idle/indolent/slothful\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">怠惰</span><rt>たいだ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"だ\" data-defn=\"be / is (plain copula)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">だ</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"と\" data-defn=\"and / with\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">と</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"おもっ\" data-defn=\"to think/to consider/to believe/to reckon; to think (of doing)/to plan (to do) (思う)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">思っ</span><rt>おもっ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"て\" data-defn=\"conjunctive particle (and / -ing)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">て</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"い\" data-defn=\"to be / to exist (auxiliary verb)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">い</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ました\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (past: did / -ed)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ました</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
