      "end": 5.1,
      "duration": 5.1
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p0_c1",
      "chunk_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "text": "「あの女性は衣服を清潔にすることがありません。",
      "text_en": "“That woman never gets her clothes clean.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"「\" data-defn=\"「 (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">「</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あの\" data-defn=\"あの (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">あの</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"じょせい\" data-defn=\"じょせい (word)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">女性</span><rt>じょせい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"いふく\" data-defn=\"clothes\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><rt>いふく</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"を\" data-defn=\"direct object marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">を</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"せいけつ\" data-defn=\"clean/hygienic/sanitary; pure/virtuous/immaculate\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">清潔</span><rt>せいけつ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"に\" data-defn=\"target / time / direction marker (to/at/in)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">に</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"する\" data-defn=\"to do\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">する</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"こと\" data-defn=\"thing / matter / fact\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">こと</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"が\" data-defn=\"subject marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">が</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"あり\" data-defn=\"there is / to exist (stem)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">あり</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ません\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (negative: do not)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ません</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
      "start": 5.45,
      "end": 9.73,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "id": "story_2067_p0_c2",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "text": "外に干している服を見てください—いつも汚れています。",
