" data-defn=\"conjunctive particle (and / -ing)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">て</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"い\" data-defn=\"to be / to exist (auxiliary verb)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">い</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ます\" data-defn=\"verb polite suffix (present/future)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">ます</span><rt></rt></ruby>。",
